{"reason": "Execution results show that validation Recall@10 plateaus early at 0.8408 because 305 out of 355 candidate trackers (86%) receive zero collaborative graph features, while tracker representations lack empirical co-occurrence priors. Expanding bipartite graph propagation to all 355 trackers in data_processing_and_feature_engineering, augmenting TrackerAttentionRankNet with multi-channel graph fusion and PPMI spectral embeddings in model_design, and synchronizing multi-channel feature routing in training_evaluation directly resolves this bottleneck and aligns structural signals with the top-10 ranking objective.", "module": ["data_processing_and_feature_engineering", "model_design", "training_evaluation"], "plan": {"data_processing_and_feature_engineering": "WHAT: Implement full 355-tracker bipartite graph neighbor propagation via sparse CSR matrix projection and extract 32-dimensional PPMI spectral co-occurrence embeddings. WHY: The baseline pipeline restricts collaborative voting to only 50 trackers and initializes tracker representations without co-occurrence structure, leaving 86% of trackers without relational graph evidence. HOW: Replace the 50-tracker loop with directed sparse adjacency projections mapping evaluation domains to labeled training domains, computing normalized in-neighbor and out-neighbor vote distributions across all 355 trackers via fast sparse matrix multiplication, and extract 32-dimensional TruncatedSVD spectral embeddings from the training label PPMI matrix. Interface constraints: Preserve standard feature file outputs (train_features.parquet, val_features.parquet, test_features.parquet), keep feature_metadata.json updated, and ensure strict domain ordering matching target.tsv.", "model_design": "WHAT: Upgrade TrackerAttentionRankNet with a multi-channel tracker graph stream and integrate PPMI spectral embeddings into the tracker metadata self-attention layer. WHY: Direct hyperlink indicators alone are sparse for embedded tracking scripts, and self-attention cannot learn 355x355 cross-tracker interactions from scratch in 12 epochs without prior co-occurrence grounding. HOW: Expand the graph stream into a multi-channel architecture ingesting direct links, in-neighbor distributions, out-neighbor distributions, and log vote counts (4 x 355 features) with a dedicated MLP projection and skip connection, while projecting the 32-dim PPMI embeddings into tracker representations before self-attention refinement, maintaining AdaptiveTop10RankingLoss. Interface constraints: Maintain model forward signature returning (batch_size, 355) logits, and preserve loss class interface callable with (logits, targets).", "training_evaluation": "WHAT: Update the training and evaluation pipeline to feed the multi-channel tracker graph features into TrackerAttentionRankNet, train with CosineAnnealingLR, and evaluate Recall@10. WHY: Feature dimensionality expansion and multi-channel graph routing require coordinated tensor extraction in data loaders to ensure seamless training, validation, and test inference. HOW: Track the multi-channel 355-tracker feature index slices from feature_cols, train for 12 epochs using AdamW (lr=1e-3, weight_decay=1e-4) with gradient clipping at 5.0, save best model weights based on validation Recall@10, and generate top-10 candidate predictions. Interface constraints: Preserve compute_recall_at_10, evaluate function signature, and save required submission files to ./submission/submission.csv and ./submission/submission.tsv matching target.tsv formatting."}, "parse_success": true, "raw_response": "{
  "reason": "Execution results show that validation Recall@10 plateaus early at 0.8408 because 305 out of 355 candidate trackers (86%) receive zero collaborative graph features, while tracker representations lack empirical co-occurrence priors. Expanding bipartite graph propagation to all 355 trackers in data_processing_and_feature_engineering, augmenting TrackerAttentionRankNet with multi-channel graph fusion and PPMI spectral embeddings in model_design, and synchronizing multi-channel feature routing in training_evaluation directly resolves this bottleneck and aligns structural signals with the top-10 ranking objective.",
  "module": [
